      "dcterms:title": "On the Deﬁnitions of Diﬀerence Galois Groups",
      "dcterms:creator": [
        "Chatzidakis∗, Zoé",
        "Hardouin, Charlotte",
        "Singer†, Michael F."
      ],
      "dcterms:issued": "D:20181119",
      "dcterms:identifier": "https://arxiv.org/abs/0705.2975",
      "dcterms:abstract": "We compare several deﬁnitions of the Galois group of a linear diﬀerence equation that have arisen in algebra, analysis and model theory and show, that these groups are isomorphic over suitable ﬁelds. In addition, we study properties of Picard-Vessiot extensions over ﬁelds with not necessarily algebraically closed subﬁelds of constants.",
